# How many ants are there on Earth?
subtitle: "Guess how many ants are alive on Earth, then see the 2022 count: twenty quadrillion, outweighing every wild bird and mammal combined."

## How many ants are there on Earth?
affirm: playful
text: {"font_size":34}
sources:
    - id: schultheiss
      title: The abundance, biomass, and distribution of ants on Earth
      authors: P. Schultheiss, S. S. Nooten, R. Wang et al.
      year: 2022
      doi: 10.1073/pnas.2201550119
      finding: 'about 20 quadrillion (2 × 10^16) ants, about 12 megatons of dry carbon: more than wild birds and wild mammals combined, about 20% of human biomass; a conservative estimate from 489 studies'

    icon ant size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 590 icon_look picture of ant hidden true
    scale count cites ["schultheiss"] y 440 unit ants min 10000000000 max 100000000000000000 value 20000000000000000 log true hidden true
    text zeros "20,000,000,000,000,000" #2f6b8f x 500 y 340 font_size 48 hidden true
    text per "2.5 million per person" #2f6b8f x 500 y 240 font_size 44 hidden true
    text mt "12 million tonnes of carbon" #b5482e x 500 y 320 font_size 44 hidden true

    card title "How many ants are on Earth?"

How many ants are alive on Earth right now?
    draw ant count

    ask "How many ants live on Earth? Click on the line: each step is ten times the last." on count store a default "1"
        right: Close. The true count is staggering.
        wrong: Not quite. See where the real count sits on the line.

That is twenty thousand trillion, or twenty quadrillion: a two followed by sixteen zeros.
    draw zeros

The number comes from a 2022 study that pooled 489 ant counts, from rainforests to deserts.
    highlight count

Shared out, that is abo (@draw per@)ut two and a half million ants for every person alive.

    erase zeros per

Each ant weighs almost nothing (@draw mt@), but together their bodies hold about twelve million tonnes of carbon.

That is more than all the wild birds and wild mammals on Earth put together.
    icon bird size 90 set twemoji x 250 y 240 icon_look picture of bird
    text vs "> all wild birds + mammals" #b5482e x 560 y 240 font_size 38

And it is a low count: ants that live underground, and whole regions without surveys, were left out.
    highlight count

So next time you see one ant, spare a thought for the other twenty quadrillion.
    highlight ant effect circle
